{
    "title": "Flourish V2 UI & Global Data Enrichment",
    "summary": "This knowledge item tracks the v2 architectural evolution, data saturation, and portfolio integrity of the Flourish platform. It documents the systematic remediation of the UK retail market, the Feb 2026 color contrast remediation, and the rollout of the database-driven Admin Panel (/admin). This transition replaces legacy JSON management with real-time Prisma-backed CRUD for managed portfolios, user roles, and advanced filtering capabilities (e.g., Regional Manager filtering for locations). It also covers core auth discoveries regarding 'additionalFields' for custom roles in sessions, alongside architectural lessons on shadcn/ui component dependencies and Next.js dynamic rendering requirements.",
